| 2004-10 |             1    |               0.86 |          0.57 |                 1    |                 1.71 |               0.23 |\n| NBA      | 2011-16 |             1    |               1    |          0.5  |                 0.83 |                 1.83 |               0.29 |\n| NBA      | 2017-21 |             1    |               1    |          0.2  |                 0.8  |                 1.8  |               0.37 |\n| NBA      | 2022-26 |             1    |               1    |          0.8  |                 0.6  |                 2    |               0.42 |\n| WNBA     | 2004-10 |             1    |               1    |          1    |                 0.5  |                 1.5  |               0.28 |\n| WNBA     | 2011-16 |             0.33 |               0.83 |          0.67 |                 0.67 |                 1    |               0.22 |\n| WNBA     | 2017-21 |             0.8  |               0.8  |          0.6  |                 0.8  |                 0.6  |               0.31 |\n| WNBA     | 2022-26 |             1    |               1    |          0.8  |                 0.8  |                 1.4  |               0.41 |\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Does roster mix predict titles better than team strength?\n\nForward-chained test (train on past seasons, predict the next champion). Higher log-likelihood is better.\n\n::: {#0846b0b2 .cell execution_count=4}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display .cell-output-markdown execution_count=4}\n| league   | model                             |   test_seasons |   mean_loglik_champion |   uniform_baseline_loglik |   mean_prob_on_champion |\n|:---------|:----------------------------------|---------------:|-----------------------:|--------------------------:|------------------------:|\n| NBA      | net rating only                   |             15 |                 -2.058 |                    -2.773 |                   0.152 |\n| NBA      | net + checklist                   |             15 |                 -2.083 |                    -2.773 |                   0.162 |\n| NBA      | net + roster mix                  |             15 |                 -2.271 |                    -2.773 |                   0.14  |\n| NBA      | net + roster mix + over-use terms |             15 |                 -2.285 |                    -2.773 |                   0.143 |\n| WNBA     | net rating only                   |             10 |                 -1.427 |                    -2.079 |                   0.303 |\n| WNBA     | net + checklist                   |             10 |                 -1.491 |                    -2.079 |                   0.295 |\n| WNBA     | net + roster mix                  |             10 |                 -1.479 |                    -2.079 |                   0.322 |\n| WNBA     | net + roster mix + over-use terms |             10 |                 -1.738 |                    -2.079 |                   0.272 |\n:::\n:::\n\n\n::: {.caveat}\n*In progress:* lineup eras (small ball, double bigs), playoff-available rosters, and team defensive profiles.\n:::\n\n",
